### 4. Nautiecs Auto-Injection
- **Keyword Detection**: Split input into words and use the top 3 longest words as the search query.
- **Code Snippet**:
  ```rust
  fn auto_inject(input: &str) -> Vec<String> {
      let words = input.split_whitespace().collect();
      let mut longest_words: Vec<String> = Vec::with_capacity(3);
      let mut max_length = 0;

      for word in words {
          if word.len() > max_length {
              max_length = word.len();
              longest_words = Vec::with_capacity(3);
              longest_words.push(word);
              if longest_words.len() == 3 {
                  break;
              }
          }
      }

      longest_words
  }
  ```

